terrelated factors, including shrubs on the forest floor."]'::jsonb, explanation = 'Official CAT 2017 Slot 2, VARC Q31. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2017-Question-Paper-Slot-2-VARC/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2017-s2-varc-q31';
