UPDATE questions SET topic = 'Odd sentence out', prompt = 'Five sentences related to a topic are given below. Four of them can be put together to form a meaningful and coherent short paragraph. Identify the odd one out. 1) In many cases time inconsistency is what prevents our going from intention to action. 2) For people to continuously postpone getting their children immunized, they would need to be constantly fooled by themselves. 3) In the specific case of immunization, however, it is hard to believe that time inconsistency by itself would be sufficient to make people permanently postpone the decision if they were fully cognizant of its benefits. 4) In most cases, even a small cost of immunization was large enough to discourage most people. 5) Not only do they have to think that they prefer to spend time going to the camp next month rather than today, they also have to believe that they will indeed go next month.', passage = NULL, options = NULL, explanation = 'Official CAT 2018 Slot 1, VARC Q27. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2018-Question-Paper-Slot-1-VARC/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2018-s1-varc-q27';
