UPDATE questions SET topic = 'Networks & Routes', prompt = 'What best can be said about the number of satellites serving C?', passage = '1600 satellites were sent up by a country for several purposes. The purposes are classified as broadcasting (B), communication (C), surveillance (S), and others (O). A satellite can serve multiple purposes; however a satellite serving either B, or C, or S does not serve O. The following facts are known about the satellites:
1. The numbers of satellites serving B, C, and S (though may be not exclusively) are in the ratio 2:1:1.
2. The number of satellites serving all three of B, C, and S is 100.
3. The number of satellites exclusively serving C is the same as the number of satellites exclusively serving S. This number is 30% of the number of satellites exclusively serving B.
4. The number of satellites serving O is the same as the number of satellites serving both C and S but not B.', options = '["Must be at least 100", "Cannot be more than 800", "Must be between 450 and 725", "Must be between 400 and 800"]'::jsonb, explanation = 'Official CAT 2018 Slot 1, DILR Q25. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2018-Question-Paper-Slot-1-DILR/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2018-s1-dilr-q25';
UPDATE questions SET answer = '2' WHERE id = 'cat-2018-s1-dilr-q25' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM answer_key_corrections c WHERE c.question_id = 'cat-2018-s1-dilr-q25');
