UPDATE questions SET topic = 'Para jumbles', prompt = 'The four sentences (labelled 1, 2, 3, and 4) given in this question, when properly sequenced, form a coherent paragraph. Decide on the proper order for the sentences and key in this sequence of four numbers as your answer.
1. Self-management is thus defined as the ‘individual’s ability to manage the symptoms, treatment, physical and psychosocial consequences and lifestyle changes inherent in living with a chronic condition’.
2. Most people with progressive diseases like dementia prefer to have control over their own lives and health-care for as long as possible.
3. Having control means, among other things, that patients themselves perform self-management activities.
4. Supporting people in decisions and actions that promote self-management is called self-management support requiring a cooperative relationship between the patient, the family, and the professionals.', passage = NULL, options = NULL, explanation = 'Official CAT 2018 Slot 2, VARC Q24. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2018-Question-Paper-Slot-2-VARC/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2018-s2-varc-q24';
