UPDATE questions SET topic = 'Odd sentence out', prompt = 'Five sentences related to a topic are given below. Four of them can be put together to form a meaningful and coherent short paragraph. Identify the odd one out.Choose its number as your answer and key it in. 1. A particularly interesting example of inference occurs in many single panel comics. 2. It’s the creator’s participation and imagination that makes the single-panel comic so engaging and so rewarding. 3. Often, the humor requires you to imagine what happened in the instant immediately before or immediately after the panel you’re being shown. 4. To get the joke, you actually have to figure out what some of these missing panels must be. 5. It is as though the cartoonist devised a series of panels to tell the story and has chosen to show you only one - and typically not even the funniest.', passage = NULL, options = NULL, explanation = 'Official CAT 2019 Slot 2, VARC Q16. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2019-Question-Paper-Slot-2-VARC/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2019-s2-varc-q16';
UPDATE questions SET answer = '2' WHERE id = 'cat-2019-s2-varc-q16' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM answer_key_corrections c WHERE c.question_id = 'cat-2019-s2-varc-q16');
UPDATE questions SET topic = 'Para jumbles', prompt = 'The four sentences (labelled 1, 2, 3, 4) given below, when properly sequenced would yield a coherent paragraph. Decide on the proper sequence of the order of the sentences and key in the sequence of the four numbers as your answer.
1. To the uninitiated listener, atonal music can sound like chaotic, random noise. 2. Atonality is a condition of music in which the constructs of the music do not ‘live’ within the confines of a particular key signature, scale, or mode. 3. After you realize the amount of knowledge, skill, and technical expertise required to compose or perform it, your tune may change, so to speak. 4. However, atonality is one of the most important movements in 20th century music.', passage = NULL, options = NULL, explanation = 'Official CAT 2019 Slot 2, VARC Q17. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2019-Question-Paper-Slot-2-VARC/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2019-s2-varc-q17';
