5. Eating plastic has a number of negative consequences such as the retention of plastic particles in the gut for longer periods than normal food particles.', passage = NULL, options = NULL, explanation = 'Official CAT 2019 Slot 2, VARC Q34. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2019-Question-Paper-Slot-2-VARC/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2019-s2-varc-q34';
