4. Komal reviewed only Q01 through Q05, Q07, Q08, Q09, Q11, and Q12.', options = '["either 0.25 or 0.75", "0.25", "lies between 0.25 and 0.50", "lies between 0.25 and 0.75"]'::jsonb, explanation = 'Official CAT 2021 Slot 3, DILR Q19. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2021-Question-Paper-Slot-3-DILR/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2021-s3-dilr-q19';
