lity” share theoretical inclinations.", "Masses are organised in patterns set by Foucault’s prisons and Habermas’ public sphere.", "Paradoxically, the capitalist rationalisation of production is a mark of so-called socialist systems as well."]'::jsonb, explanation = 'Official CAT 2022 Slot 1, VARC Q22. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2022-Question-Paper-Slot-1-VARC/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2022-s1-varc-q22';
