ith’s criticism of the consumerism and inequality of contemporary society."]'::jsonb, explanation = 'Official CAT 2023 Slot 1, VARC Q11. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2023-Question-Paper-Slot-1-VARC/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2023-s1-varc-q11';
