1. All slots were full.
2. The number of US applications was the same in all the slots. The same was true for the other three categories.
3. 50% of the applications were US applications.
4. All applicants except Ira, Vijay and Nandini arrived on time.
5. Vijay was called to a counter at 9:25 am.', options = '["2:05 pm", "2:25 pm", "2:00 pm", "3:40 pm"]'::jsonb, explanation = 'Official CAT 2023 Slot 1, DILR Q5. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2023-Question-Paper-Slot-1-DILR/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2023-s1-dilr-q05';
