nding of their own culture."]'::jsonb, explanation = 'Official CAT 2024 Slot 3, VARC Q5. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2024-Question-Paper-Slot-3-VARC/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2024-s3-varc-q05';
