UPDATE questions SET topic = 'Sentence placement', prompt = 'There is a sentence that is missing in the paragraph below. Look at the paragraph and decide where (option 1, 2, 3, or 4) the following sentence would best fit. Sentence: This reality is putting stress on employees who have to pay for transport, desk lunches, more childcare, clothing and that after-work socialisation - costs they haven’t incurred for nearly two years. Paragraph: ___(1)___. Prices are rising at their fastest rate in 40 years; consequently, return-to-office-related costs have shot up - think petrol and food, for instance.___(2)___. Yet wages haven’t kept up with inflation - even despite the salary growth many workers have enjoyed during a favourable pandemic labour market. ___(3)___.This is especially jarring for workers who were able to save during remote work, when these expenditures weren’t a factor. ___(4)___. In April 2022, Umus, a London university lecturer, told BBC Worklife that they were spending nearly a quarter of what they made every day on return-to-work costs.', passage = NULL, options = '["Option 4", "Option 3", "Option 2", "Option 1"]'::jsonb, explanation = 'Official CAT 2024 Slot 3, VARC Q20. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2024-Question-Paper-Slot-3-VARC/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2024-s3-varc-q20';
