 the act."]'::jsonb, explanation = 'Official CAT 2025 Slot 1, VARC Q18. Answer key cross-checked against https://online.2iim.com/CAT-question-paper/CAT-2025-Question-Paper-Slot-1-VARC/', has_figure = FALSE WHERE id = 'cat-2025-s1-varc-q18';
